graph TB
    Request[客户端请求]
    
    Gateway[API网关<br/>ApiGatewayFilter]
    
    SentinelEntry[Sentinel Entry<br/>流量控制入口]
    
    RuleCheck{规则检查}
    FlowRule[流控规则<br/>QPS限流]
    HotParamRule[热点参数<br/>限流]
    SystemRule[系统规则<br/>CPU/负载]
    
    CircuitBreaker[熔断器<br/>Resilience4j]
    CBState{熔断器状态}
    
    RemoteAPI[远程API调用<br/>RemoteApiClient]
    
    Fallback[降级处理<br/>返回默认值]
    Success[成功响应]
    BlockException[限流拒绝<br/>429错误]
    
    Request --> Gateway
    Gateway --> SentinelEntry
    
    SentinelEntry --> RuleCheck
    RuleCheck --> FlowRule
    RuleCheck --> HotParamRule
    RuleCheck --> SystemRule
    
    FlowRule -->|通过| CircuitBreaker
    FlowRule -->|拒绝| BlockException
    
    HotParamRule -->|通过| CircuitBreaker
    HotParamRule -->|拒绝| BlockException
    
    SystemRule -->|通过| CircuitBreaker
    SystemRule -->|拒绝| BlockException
    
    CircuitBreaker --> CBState
    CBState -->|CLOSED 关闭| RemoteAPI
    CBState -->|OPEN 打开| Fallback
    CBState -->|HALF_OPEN 半开| RemoteAPI
    
    RemoteAPI -->|成功| Success
    RemoteAPI -->|失败| CircuitBreaker
    
    Success --> Gateway
    Fallback --> Gateway
    BlockException --> Gateway
    
    style FlowRule fill:#3b82f6,color:#fff
    style HotParamRule fill:#8b5cf6,color:#fff
    style SystemRule fill:#06b6d4,color:#fff
    style CircuitBreaker fill:#f59e0b,color:#fff
    style Fallback fill:#10b981,color:#fff
    style BlockException fill:#ef4444,color:#fff
